      tags: ["xt02", "xt01", "rv16"],
      stem: "$X_1,X_2$ 独立同分布于 $U(0,1)$，记 $Y_1=\\min(X_1,X_2)$、$Y_2=\\max(X_1,X_2)$，计算 $E[X_1\\mid Y_2]$．",
